    "synopsis": {
        "native": "Suzy, trentenaire, vit seule... ou presque. Sa m\u00e8re, Madeleine, qui habite juste \u00e0 c\u00f4t\u00e9 s\u2019immisce fr\u00e9quemment chez elle pour oublier son quotidien peu enthousiaste. Mais Suzy qui perd son boulot et son petit ami n\u2019est pas dans ses meilleurs jours pour subir les vas et vient de sa m\u00e8re. Quoi qu'il en soit, Madeleine doit vider son sac \u00ab pour le bien de Suzy \u00bb mais surtout pour se lib\u00e9rer elle-m\u00eame. Suzy affronte chaque \u00e9tape la t\u00eate haute ou presque...",
        "english": "Thirty-year-old Suzy live alone... or almost. Her mother, Madeleine, who lives right nearby, frequently comes over and gets involved in Suzy's life in order to forget her own lacklustre existence. But Suzy, who loses her job and is dumped by her boyfriend, isn't in the best state of mind to put up with her mother's interfering. No matter, Madeleine still needs to let off steam \"for Suzy's sake,\" but, mainly so as to free herself. Suzy copes with each phase, her head held high... or almost."
    },
